\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Best configuration per prefetcher family vs.\ the no-prefetch baseline, for all benchmarks and all four placement/memory cases. Red lines mark the default configuration of each family.}}{12}{figure.1}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Diagnostic prefetch-quality metrics vs.\ speedup for selected configurations. Each panel shows the metric most relevant for one benchmark, in its most representative placement/memory case: (a) SpMV accuracy, (b) quick-sort coverage, (c) BFS unused-prefetch ratio, (d) STREAM Triad late-prefetch ratio. Higher is better for accuracy and coverage; lower is better for unused and late ratios.}}{16}{figure.2}%
